parts+=['## 2. Shared pattern','Supply two equally shaped matrices and two numerical scalars; calculate their scalar-weighted sum/difference entry by entry. A whole-matrix radio answer or four scalar blank fragments is required. No matrix multiplication, unknown scalar solving, third matrix, determinants, symbolic variables or new topics.','The ordered five stages are: supplied matrices with their scalars → two explicit entrywise-product matrices → two evaluated scaled matrices → one matrix of ordered entrywise sum/difference expressions → one collected result matrix. Distinct masks preserve every product and both operands before collection. The full introductory prose derives names, scalar values, and add/subtract verb from the instance. q-126009 writes +(-v) for adding a negative; q-320671 writes −v shorthand.','## 3. Complete component and bank mapping','Indices below are row-major zero-based. A/B are supplied values, X=aA and Y=bB, C=X±Y. Each complete bank is chosen before parameters and used as a whole; every pair of matrices, including two wrong options, must differ entrywise. No first-valid recipe replacement. All original choice values below match exactly. Labels describe parameterized replay masks, not recovered author intent.']
